[
  {
    "title": "Counted Loops",
    "tag": "LESSON 13",
    "time": "0–2 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.J/K · Counted iteration",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">AP Computer Science Principles</p><h1>Counted Loops</h1><p class=\"zh\">计数循环 · 计数器 · 累加器</p><p class=\"small\">90 minutes · Repeat a block a known number of times.</p>",
    "note": "前两课选择改变路径，本课重复改变执行次数。用计数器与累加器区分“做过几次”和“总共多少”，再让学生输入三次分钟并累计。只用固定次数循环，不引入REPEAT UNTIL条件循环。",
    "kind": "dark"
  },
  {
    "title": "Retrieve current values and order",
    "tag": "RETRIEVAL · ORIGINAL",
    "time": "2–6 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.B · AAP-2.H",
    "html": "<ol><li>x is 4. Execute x ← x + 2. What is x now?</li><li>Does assignment keep the old and new values in the same variable?</li><li>A false IF has no ELSE. Does its body execute?</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">6; no, the assigned value replaces the previous value; no, that body is skipped.</div></details>",
    "note": "第一题和第二题提取第一章赋值与追踪，第三题提取L11被跳过的代码块。提醒学生x←x+2先求右侧旧值4+2再存6；循环会反复执行这个步骤，不能每次都使用最初的4。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Learning goals",
    "tag": "GOALS",
    "time": "6–8 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.J/K · Counted iteration",
    "html": "<ol><li>Trace REPEAT n TIMES one iteration at a time.</li><li>Use a counter and an accumulator correctly.</li><li>Explain initialization, update order and zero iterations.</li><li>Build and modify a program that processes three inputs.</li></ol><p class=\"callout\">Iteration 迭代 = one execution of the loop body.</p>",
    "note": "目标既包括预测，也包括实际编写。次数n为已知非负整数，本课保持循环次数不在体内改变；不讲条件停止或无限循环。最后用总分钟与已读次数为L16学习目标记录器提供基础，但不提前做完整项目。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Replace repeated actions with one block",
    "tag": "REPETITION",
    "time": "8–12 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.J.1",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"First time: same action → Second time: same action → Third time: same action\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">First time</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">same action</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Second time</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">same action</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Third time</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">same action</text></svg></figure><p>A counted loop expresses the repeated block once and specifies how many times to execute it.</p><p class=\"small\">The actions still execute three times; only the written code becomes shorter.</p>",
    "note": "图表示执行次数不是三份数据必须相同。每次INPUT可得到不同输入，每次赋值可看到新的当前状态。明确缩短代码不等于减少题目要求处理的三次输入。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Read the REPEAT structure",
    "tag": "AP PSEUDOCODE",
    "time": "12–16 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.K.2",
    "html": "<div class=\"visual-row\"><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:29px;line-height:1.25;padding:16px;margin:12px 0\">REPEAT 3 TIMES\n{\n  DISPLAY(&quot;Hi&quot;)\n}</pre><p>The number gives the number of iterations.</p><p>The braces enclose the whole repeated block.</p><p>After the final iteration, continue below the loop.</p></div><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">The program displays Hi three times.</div></details>",
    "note": "先数大括号里的语句，再确定重复的范围。多条语句属于同一个body，每次都按顺序执行。这里显示三次Hi，只是语法示例，不把有界循环解释成同时并行执行。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A counter records how many",
    "tag": "COUNTER 计数器",
    "time": "16–20 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.K.a/b · AAP-1.B",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Initialize: count ← 0 → After one: count = 1 → After two: count = 2 → After three: count = 3\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"248.75\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"144.375\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Initialize</text><text x=\"144.375\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">count ← 0</text><path d=\"M276.75 97H302.75\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M302.75 91L314.75 97L302.75 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"323.75\" y=\"20\" width=\"248.75\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"448.125\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">After one</text><text x=\"448.125\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">count = 1</text><path d=\"M580.5 97H606.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M606.5 91L618.5 97L606.5 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"627.5\" y=\"20\" width=\"248.75\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"751.875\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">After two</text><text x=\"751.875\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">count = 2</text><path d=\"M884.25 97H910.25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M910.25 91L922.25 97L910.25 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"931.25\" y=\"20\" width=\"248.75\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1055.625\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">After three</text><text x=\"1055.625\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">count = 3</text></svg></figure><p>Execute <span class=\"mono\">count ← count + 1</span> once per iteration.</p><p class=\"small\">The diagram shows a worked example with three iterations.</p>",
    "note": "计数器通常每次加1，但命名和用途比变量本身特殊更重要。count不是循环语法自带的变量，必须自己初始化和更新。初始0表示还没完成任何一次，完成一次后1。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Predict before updating",
    "tag": "TRACE · ORIGINAL",
    "time": "20–24 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.K.b",
    "html": "<div class=\"visual-row\"><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:25px;line-height:1.25;padding:16px;margin:12px 0\">count ← 1\nREPEAT 3 TIMES\n{\n  DISPLAY(count)\n  count ← count + 2\n}</pre><p>Write the three outputs in order, then the final value of count.</p><p>DISPLAY comes before the update.</p></div><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Outputs: <strong>1, 3, 5</strong>. Final count: <strong>7</strong>.</div></details>",
    "note": "先每轮显示旧的当前值，再加2。最后的7只保存在变量中，没有被这个程序显示。若学生回答3/5/7，说明把更新挪到显示前；若回答1/1/1，说明未保留跨轮状态。"
  },
  {
    "title": "An accumulator records how much",
    "tag": "ACCUMULATOR 累加器",
    "time": "24–28 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.K.a · AAP-1.B",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Start: total = 0 → Add first: total + value₁ → Add next: total + value₂\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Start</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">total = 0</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Add first</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">total + value₁</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Add next</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">total + value₂</text></svg></figure><p>An accumulator combines values across iterations.</p><p class=\"callout\">Initialize once before the loop; update inside it.</p>",
    "note": "用收到三张分钟卡的实物活动，total是累计分钟而不是已收到卡数。图中value₁/value₂为说明标签，不作为实验室变量名要求。sum与counter都可用加法，但更新量不同、含义不同。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Trace a running total",
    "tag": "WORKED EXAMPLE",
    "time": "28–32 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.K.b",
    "html": "<div class=\"visual-row\"><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:25px;line-height:1.25;padding:16px;margin:12px 0\">total ← 0\nREPEAT 4 TIMES\n{\n  total ← total + 5\n}\nDISPLAY(total)</pre><table style=\"font-size:25px\"><thead><tr><th>Completed iterations</th><th>total</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>20</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"small\">Four additions of 5 produce a final total of 20.</p>",
    "note": "这里是完整示范，表中0行是循环之前，不算一次执行。强调每轮右侧total使用上一轮保存的值；最后DISPLAY在循环外所以只显示一次20。若学生把初始行算一次循环，用不同底色区分准备和执行。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Resetting inside loses earlier work",
    "tag": "INITIALIZATION",
    "time": "32–36 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.K.a/b · CRD-2.I",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Before loop: total ← 0 once → Each iteration: add current value → After loop: keep accumulated total\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Before loop</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">total ← 0 once</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Each iteration</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">add current value</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">After loop</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">keep accumulated total</text></svg></figure><p>Bug: reset total to 0 inside every iteration, then add 5. Repeat four times.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">The incorrect final total is <strong>5</strong>, because each reset discards the previous total. Move initialization before the loop to obtain 20.</div></details>",
    "note": "让学生用4轮记录0→5、0→5、0→5、0→5，理解累加丢失原因。修复是移动初始化，不是把循环次数改成更大的数。图表现正确流程，练习文字中的错误结果隐藏，先让学生预测。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Update order changes which values are added",
    "tag": "COMPARE · ORIGINAL",
    "time": "36–40 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.K.b · AAP-2.L.2",
    "html": "<div class=\"visual-row\"><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;padding:16px;margin:12px 0\">i ← 1\ntotal ← 0\nREPEAT 3 TIMES\n{\n  total ← total + i\n  i ← i + 1\n}</pre><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;padding:16px;margin:12px 0\">i ← 1\ntotal ← 0\nREPEAT 3 TIMES\n{\n  i ← i + 1\n  total ← total + i\n}</pre></div><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Left adds 1 + 2 + 3 = <strong>6</strong>. Right adds 2 + 3 + 4 = <strong>9</strong>. Both finish with i = 4.</div></details>",
    "note": "分别列本轮加入的数字，不要只看两段代码有相同语句就断言等价。i不是REPEAT 3的控制次数；它是由程序更新的普通变量。两段final i相同而total不同，是观察一个变量不足以判断结果相同的例子。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Zero iterations skip the body",
    "tag": "ZERO TIMES",
    "time": "40–44 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.K.1–2",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Before loop: count = 7 → REPEAT 0 TIMES: body is skipped → After loop: continue execution\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Before loop</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">count = 7</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">REPEAT 0 TIMES</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">body is skipped</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">After loop</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">continue execution</text></svg></figure><p>The body would add 1 to count. Predict count after this zero-count loop.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>7</strong>. There are zero updates. An INPUT in that skipped body would consume no queued input.</div></details>",
    "note": "CED说明迭代可零次执行。本课零次由固定次数0给出，不引入条件循环。变量在循环前已经初始化，跳过循环不意味着删除变量或终止程序；循环后语句仍继续。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A loop can contain a fixed-count loop",
    "tag": "NESTED REPETITION",
    "time": "44–48 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.J/K · Teacher extension: fixed nested loops",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two outer iterations; each contains three inner iterations. Six inner-block executions altogether.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 265\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Each cell = one execution of the inner block</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"55\" width=\"1160\" height=\"88\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Outer 1</text><rect x=\"260\" y=\"67\" width=\"267\" height=\"62\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"393\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Inner 1</text><rect x=\"555\" y=\"67\" width=\"267\" height=\"62\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"688\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Inner 2</text><rect x=\"850\" y=\"67\" width=\"267\" height=\"62\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"983\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Inner 3</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"154\" width=\"1160\" height=\"88\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"208\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Outer 2</text><rect x=\"260\" y=\"166\" width=\"267\" height=\"62\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"393\" y=\"207\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Inner 1</text><rect x=\"555\" y=\"166\" width=\"267\" height=\"62\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"688\" y=\"207\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Inner 2</text><rect x=\"850\" y=\"166\" width=\"267\" height=\"62\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"983\" y=\"207\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">Inner 3</text></svg></figure><p>For each outer iteration, the inner loop completes all three iterations.</p><p class=\"callout\">Total inner-block executions: 2 × 3 = 6.</p>",
    "note": "按先第一行三格再第二行三格朗读，不能在外内循环间交替只各执行一次。此处只是固定嵌套入门，不混入IF和条件停止。图中的每格是一轮inner body而不是一个独立声明的循环。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Trace nested blocks by indentation",
    "tag": "ORIGINAL PRACTICE",
    "time": "48–52 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.K.b",
    "html": "<div class=\"visual-row\"><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;padding:16px;margin:12px 0\">count ← 0\nREPEAT 2 TIMES\n{\n  REPEAT 3 TIMES\n  {\n    count ← count + 1\n  }\n}\nDISPLAY(count)</pre><div><p>How many times does the update execute?</p><p>Predict the final output.</p><p>The inner loop starts a fresh three iterations each time it is reached.</p></div></div><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">The update executes <strong>6</strong> times; the final output is <strong>6</strong>.</div></details>",
    "note": "外层body完整包住内层循环，每次进入都执行3次。不是2+3，两个层次不是前后独立的循环。此题更新次数与输出相同，因为count初始化0并每次加1；换初值后不能直接把次数当输出。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Plan three inputs and one total",
    "tag": "PREPARE THE LAB",
    "time": "52–55 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.K.a · CRD-2.J",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Initialize: total ← 0 → Repeat 3 times: read + add minutes → After loop: display total\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Initialize</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">total ← 0</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Repeat 3 times</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">read + add minutes</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">After loop</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">display total</text></svg></figure><p>Each input is a valid whole number from 0 through 180.</p><p class=\"small\">Use three separate numeric lines in the input queue.</p>",
    "note": "输入有效由题目保证，不写范围验证分支。三个INPUT调用发生在三轮中，代码里只写一条INPUT。循环后输出一次累计值，不能只输出最后一次minutes。准备10、20、30作为第一组预测。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab: predict and prepare the queue",
    "tag": "PROGRAMMING · 55–60",
    "time": "55–60 min",
    "code": "Practical coding · AAP-2.K",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\"><a href=\"Chapter_3_Programming_Lab.html#counted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open the counted-loop lab ↗</a></p><div class=\"visual-row\"><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:30px;line-height:1.25;padding:16px;margin:12px 0\">10\n20\n30</pre><p>Enter this input queue: one JSON number per line.</p><p>Predict the total after each input and the final output.</p></div><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Running totals: <strong>10, 30, 60</strong>. Final output: <strong>60</strong>.</div></details>",
    "note": "先纸面写三个累计值再进入运行。输入10/20/30各在一行，不能用逗号连接成一个值，也不带双引号。教师检查学生在第一轮总量10而不是0，明确INPUT后再加。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab: build a three-input accumulator",
    "tag": "PROGRAMMING · 60–66",
    "time": "60–66 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.K.a",
    "html": "<div class=\"visual-row\"><ol><li>Initialize total before the loop.</li><li>Read and add one value per iteration.</li><li>Display total after the loop.</li></ol><details><summary>Show model after your first attempt</summary><div class=\"answer\"><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;padding:16px;margin:12px 0\">total ← 0\nREPEAT 3 TIMES\n{\n  minutes ← INPUT()\n  total ← total + minutes\n}\nDISPLAY(total)</pre></div></details></div>",
    "note": "六分钟必须由学生编写并运行。展示模型前要求先完成自己的第一版，错误记录也是测试证据。模型每条语句和大括号独立行，total初始化与最终输出分别在循环两侧。若输入不足，先检查队列与调用次数，不靠增加重复次数修复。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab: test values that reveal lost work",
    "tag": "PROGRAMMING · 66–71",
    "time": "66–71 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.J.1–3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Each slash separates inputs here; the lab uses separate lines; 0 / 0 / 0: three zero inputs, 30 / 45 / 15: different inputs, 180 / 180 / 180: upper extremes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Each slash separates inputs here; the lab uses separate lines</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">0 / 0 / 0</text><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">three zero inputs</text><rect x=\"416.6666666666667\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">30 / 45 / 15</text><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">different inputs</text><rect x=\"783.3333333333334\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">180 / 180 / 180</text><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">upper extremes</text></svg></figure><p>Predict the final total, then record expected and actual results.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Totals: <strong>0, 90, 540</strong>. The second case helps reveal a program that displays only the last input.</div></details>",
    "note": "斜线只是幻灯片紧凑表示，明确实验室输入仍各行一个数。全零无法区分正确累加与每次清零，差异值30/45/15可揭露只显示最后值15。上界组540检查总量可超过单个输入上限180，不应错误截断。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab: add a count and an average",
    "tag": "PROGRAMMING · 71–76",
    "time": "71–76 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.M.1 · AAP-2.K.a",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Before loop: count ← 0 → Inside loop: count ← count + 1 → After loop: average ← total / count\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Before loop</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">count ← 0</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Inside loop</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">count ← count + 1</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">After loop</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">average ← total / count</text></svg></figure><p>Keep REPEAT 3 TIMES. Display total, count and average after the loop.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">For inputs 30, 45, 15: total <strong>90</strong>, count <strong>3</strong>, average <strong>30</strong>.</div></details>",
    "note": "修改有明确新增需求而非改名字：已读次数与平均值。因为本程序固定读3次，count最终3且除数非0；不要泛化为任意零次程序也能无条件相除。REPEAT次数保持3，不在体内改变任何作为循环次数的n。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab: explain where each line belongs",
    "tag": "PROGRAMMING · 76–80",
    "time": "76–80 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.K · CRD-2.J",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Before: initialize once → Inside: read and update → After: summarize once\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Before</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">initialize once</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Inside</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">read and update</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">After</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">summarize once</text></svg></figure><p>Submit your code, at least three tests and one explanation of a corrected mistake.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">One useful explanation: placing total ← 0 inside the loop erased earlier inputs; moving it before the loop preserved the accumulated sum.</div></details>",
    "note": "四分钟同伴复查：总量和count初始化各一次，读取与更新各三次，显示各一次。不要只看最终输出是否相同，要能指出实际执行次数。学生保留修改后的count与average版本，为之后项目组合提供依据。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Which two statements are correct?",
    "tag": "AP-STYLE · SELECT TWO",
    "time": "80–83 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.K · AAP-1.B",
    "html": "<ol><li>A. REPEAT 0 TIMES executes its body once.</li><li>B. A counter must be initialized before its current value is used.</li><li>C. Every accumulator should reset inside each iteration.</li><li>D. Two outer iterations with three inner iterations each execute the inner body six times.</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>B and D.</strong> Zero iterations skip the body. Repeatedly resetting an accumulator discards earlier work.</div></details>",
    "note": "要求每项解释理由，尤其D用两行三格图而不是死记乘法。B限定在当前值要被读取时，避免说所有变量必须在程序第一行统一声明。全部原创练习，不是官方考题。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Homework and the next lesson",
    "tag": "CONSOLIDATE",
    "time": "83–85 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.J/K · Counted iteration",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">12 original questions · 30 classroom marks · about 40 minutes.</p><ol><li>Separate initial state from completed iterations.</li><li>Track outputs and final variable values separately.</li><li>Check initialization and update order.</li></ol><p class=\"callout\">Next: repeat until a condition becomes true.</p>",
    "note": "作业要求保留追踪步骤，不只给最后数字。循环语句只使用REPEAT n TIMES，条件循环下一课才正式学习。固定嵌套题只追踪两层很小次数，不扩大成复杂模式输出。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Exit ticket: count the executions",
    "tag": "EXIT · ORIGINAL",
    "time": "85–90 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.J/K · Counted iteration",
    "html": "<ol><li>count starts at 0. Four iterations each add 2. Final count?</li><li>How many body executions occur for REPEAT 0 TIMES?</li><li>Two outer iterations each run three inner iterations. Inner total?</li><li>Why is total ← 0 usually before an accumulation loop?</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">1. 8. 2. 0. 3. 6. 4. To initialize once without erasing previous iterations’ contributions.</div></details>",
    "note": "收集四项诊断，建议至少3项正确且初始化题能解释。把错误定位到次数、更新量还是初始化，不笼统归为“循环没懂”。若第1项答4，需区分执行次数与变量增长量；若第3项答5，回到嵌套图分组计数。"
  }
]
